entries.msgstr:
The default Flashlight state at the start of battle. You can toggle the Flashlight on or off using the assigned hotkey at any time.

When enabled, the Flashlight functions only in Sniper mode.

Supported game modes:
• Random Battles and Team Training;
• Frontline;
• Arcade Battles;
• Onslaught;
• Certain other modes and events. 

Additional modes and events may be supported in future.
